Numeric-to-string audit: commits cb75740, f4272fd, and 17b46bd add five pinned Java heartbeat DTO inputs for `topic` and `tagsSet`. Java preserves the full plain decimal token 9223372036854775807.123456789012345678901. Exponent tokens follow Java numeric formatting: 1e2 and 1.0e2 become 100.0, and 1.234567890123456789e2 becomes 123.45678901234568. The previous native f64 conversion lost plain-decimal digits; retaining every raw token unchanged also mismatched the exponent cases. Fix 5e30b73 stores integer/plain-decimal lexemes and uses the observed floating representation for exponent forms.
